WEBVTT

00:06:59.036 --> 00:07:01.676
Only that amount of wild nature,

00:07:01.716 --> 00:07:04.676
together with a massive reduction
in carbon emissions,

00:07:04.716 --> 00:07:06.596
will be able to get us back on track.

00:07:07.316 --> 00:07:08.476
And of course,

00:07:08.516 --> 00:07:11.956
we need to manage our activities
more responsibly everywhere else.

00:07:12.476 --> 00:07:15.476
"30 by 30" will involve
a combination of strategies.

00:07:16.036 --> 00:07:18.476
From national parks
and marine protected areas,

00:07:18.516 --> 00:07:22.476
to lands managed by Indigenous peoples
and local communities,

00:07:22.516 --> 00:07:25.596
which have been effective
in preventing habitat loss,

00:07:25.636 --> 00:07:29.596
often more effectively
than conventional conservation methods.